; The "open journal" of the import-rules DISCOVERY fixture.
;
; What matters about this file is WHERE IT LIVES, not what it says: its own
; directory is the scan root `rules::discover` confines to, so the tree beside
; it is the whole fixture. See fixtures/rules/README.md.
;
; It is still a real journal, because the fixtures-wide sweeps
; (`diagnostics.rs`, `balance_assertions.rs`) parse every `*.journal` under
; `fixtures/` and require it to be clean.

